orum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1134553-3e-infernals-change-of-direction/page6\"> 3E Infernals - Change of Direction - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1134553-3e-infernals-change-of-direction/page6\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1134553-3e-infernals-change-of-direction/page6 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So recently the name of the Eclipse Caste Equivalent of the Infernals, called Penumbra Caste got revealed. A thread was made for discussing what the rest of the </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449576-what-if-a-portal-appears-to-creation\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449576-what-if-a-portal-appears-to-creation\"> [What-If] A portal appears to Creation - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449576-what-if-a-portal-appears-to-creation\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449576-what-if-a-portal-appears-to-creation </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> One day while you're setting in your room a portal opens up in your house. Looking through the portal you can see that is a portal leading into a city of Creation. You are not sure where exactly in Creation, but you just somehow know. A voice in your head tells you that you have one hour to prepare. You then have an overwhelming feeling and knowledge that going into this portal is the best thing you can possibly do. How do you prepare? What would you bring with you? Also in case you ask &amp;quot;Does X work in Creation&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;Do I know X&amp;quot;, then the answer is you don't know. Those are things </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449524-what-did-the-mountainfolk-and-dragon-kings-stand-to-gain-from-the-rebellion/page2\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449524-what-did-the-mountainfolk-and-dragon-kings-stand-to-gain-from-the-rebellion/page2\"> What did the mountainfolk and dragon kings stand to gain from the Rebellion? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449524-what-did-the-mountainfolk-and-dragon-kings-stand-to-gain-from-the-rebellion/page2\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1449524-what-did-the-mountainfolk-and-dragon-kings-stand-to-gain-from-the-rebellion/page2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> what is the point of risking everything just so you can replace distant overlords with close ones? (and in the case of the dragon kings very close indeed) </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</spa