ppens a lot.<br /> <br /> By the way, what degree of thread necromancy is allowed in the Exalted and other gameline forums? Is it OK to reply to a 3-year old thread like this one? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/533482-argatoi-the-brass-turtles-demons-of-the-first-circle\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-first-circle</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Good question, it has been a few years since someone last tinkered with it.<br /> <br /> If feeling uncertain about exhuming this one, maybe you could &quot;export&quot; some of its contents by reposting into a fresher but already existing thread, one on 1st circle demons.<br /> <br /> Like this one, for example - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/223770-homebrews-of-the-first-circle/page17\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-circle/page17</a><br /> <br /> Seems like a win-win to me. Hope my suggestion helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 08-27-2021, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-28T04:13:02-07:00","id":1457891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/trouble-tickets/1435825-exalted-forum-not-updating-again?p=1457792#post1457792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-